\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par I believe in God, 
\par the Father Almighty,
\par the Creator of heaven and earth,
\par and in Jesus Christ, 
\par His only Son, our Lord:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Who was conceived 
\par of the Holy Spirit,
\par born of the Virgin Mary,
\par suffered under Pontius Pilate,
\par was crucified, died, 
\par and was buried.
\par He descended into hell.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par The third day 
\par He arose again from the dead.
\par He ascended into heaven
\par and sits at the right hand of 
\par God the Father Almighty,
\par whence He shall come to judge 
\par the living and the dead.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par I believe in the Holy Spirit, 
\par the holy catholic church,
\par the communion of saints,
\par the forgiveness of sins,
\par the resurrection of the body,
\par and life everlasting. Amen.
\par 
\par 
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

